{
  "name": "Small Business AI Assistant - Prompt Layer + MCP Tool Connections",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1 - A REQUEST COMES IN FROM ANY CHANNEL\n\nChat widget, email, or an internal form. Every request lands in the same lane so one set of prompts serves all of them.",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "e0818a3b-9b9e-5f41-9095-9a4ab2896485",
      "name": "Section - 1 - A REQUEST COMES IN FROM ANY CHANNEL",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2 - LOAD THE BUSINESS'S PROMPT PROFILE\n\nTone, services, pricing rules, and what the assistant is never allowed to promise live in a sheet the owner can edit. No code change to update a prompt.",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "0d3a928b-67ff-5efd-9302-be3c1f7dd2ef",
      "name": "Section - 2 - LOAD THE BUSINESS'S PROMPT PROFILE",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        560,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3 - CLAUDE DECIDES AND USES THE BUSINESS'S OWN TOOLS\n\nEach tool is an MCP connection into software the business already pays for. Claude reads and writes real records instead of guessing.",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 1420,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "aa6dd941-8538-59ce-a1d2-b7c3731c9c99",
      "name": "Section - 3 - CLAUDE DECIDES AND USES THE BUSINESS'S OWN TOOLS",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1220,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4 - CHECK THE ANSWER BEFORE IT GOES OUT\n\nAnything touching money, bookings, or a complaint goes to a human first. Everything else replies on its own.",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "dcc1bb8d-7e96-50e0-a0d4-7666c935bfbd",
      "name": "Section - 4 - CHECK THE ANSWER BEFORE IT GOES OUT",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2860,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 5 - LOG IT SO THE PROMPTS GET BETTER EVERY WEEK\n\nEvery exchange is scored. Low-scoring ones become next week's prompt revisions.",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 1
      },
